34. Rank Products by Sales Within Category

PySpark:

from pyspark.sql.window import Window
from pyspark.sql.functions import dense_rank

w = Window.partitionBy(
"category"
).orderBy(df.sales.desc())

df.withColumn(
"rank",
dense_rank().over(w)
)

SQL:

SELECT *,
DENSE_RANK() OVER(
PARTITION BY category
ORDER BY sales DESC
) rank
FROM products;
